ERROR 23505: duplicate key value violates unique constraint "mvp_a"
DETAIL: Key (a)=(1) already exists.
CONTEXT: SQL statement "INSERT INTO public.mvp SELECT (diff.newdata).* FROM pg_temp_N.pg_temp_N_2 diff WHERE tid IS NULL"
OBJECTS: schema=public table=mvp constraint=mvp_a

> DELETE FROM mb WHERE b = 'uno'
-- DELETE 1

